flowchart LR
    classDef branch fill:#EAF2FB,stroke:#1F2A44,color:#1F2A44,font-weight:600;
    classDef gate fill:#FDF1DE,stroke:#C9820F,color:#6B4508,font-weight:600;

    Main[(main branch — always releasable)]:::branch --> Branch[Create short-lived feature branch, less than 2 days]:::branch
    Branch --> Code[Implement plus write unit tests]:::branch
    Code --> PR[Open Pull Request, linked to Story and Acceptance Criterion]:::branch
    PR --> CI{CI: lint, build, tests}:::gate
    CI -- red --> Code
    CI -- green --> Review{Peer review: at least 1 approval}:::gate
    Review -- changes requested --> Code
    Review -- approved --> Merge[Merge to main]:::branch
    Merge --> Main
